stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WaitingForPlayers

    WaitingForPlayers --> RoomReady: Six players joined
    WaitingForPlayers --> Cancelled: Waiting timeout reached

    RoomReady --> CaseReading: Case assigned
    CaseReading --> InitialVoting: Reading timer completed

    InitialVoting --> Discussion: Initial votes submitted
    InitialVoting --> Discussion: Voting timer expired

    Discussion --> FinalVoting: Deliberation timer completed
    Discussion --> Paused: Server or room failure
    Paused --> Discussion: Room state recovered
    Paused --> Cancelled: Recovery failed

    FinalVoting --> CalculatingResult: All votes submitted
    FinalVoting --> CalculatingResult: Voting timer expired

    CalculatingResult --> ResultPublished: Verdict calculated
    ResultPublished --> Feedback: Result displayed

    Feedback --> Completed: Feedback timer completed
    Completed --> [*]

    Cancelled --> [*]